    "body": "Update:\r\n\r\nThis bug seems related to starship trying to read symlinks to network attached storage when the network is down.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWith internet disabled:\r\n\r\n```\r\n~\r\n❯ starship timings\r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n hg_branch   -  204580ms  -   \"\"\r\n directory   -      <1ms  -   \"~ \"\r\n line_break  -      <1ms  -   \"\\n\"\r\n character   -      <1ms  -   \"❯ \"\r\n\r\n~ took 3m24s\r\n❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith internet enabled:\r\n\r\n```\r\n~\r\n❯ starship timings\r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n hg_branch   -  22ms  -   \"\"\r\n directory   -  <1ms  -   \"~ \"\r\n line_break  -  <1ms  -   \"\\n\"\r\n character   -  <1ms  -   \"❯ \"\r\n\r\n~\r\n❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nEdit: disabling `hg_branch` does not resolve the issue.\r\n\r\nWith internet disabled, and hg_branch disabled:\r\n\r\n```\r\n~\r\n❯ starship timings\r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n docker_context  -  208154ms  -   \"\"\r\n directory       -       2ms  -   \"~ \"\r\n line_break      -      <1ms  -   \"\\n\"\r\n character       -      <1ms  -   \"❯ \"\r\n\r\n~ took 3m28s\r\n❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I continue to disable the \"slow\" module, another one takes it's place:\r\n\r\n- hg_branch\r\n- docker_context\r\n- package\r\n- cmake\r\n- cobol\r\n- dart\r\n- deno\r\n- .... and so on",
