    "body": "> Is this only happening in your home folder or everywhere? I tried to reproduce it with a symlink to an SFTP mount...\r\n\r\nThanks for looking into this! \r\n\r\nIt happens in any directory with symlinks to a Samba share (mounted with cifs-utils).\r\n\r\n> To confirm, the findings, scan duration should be logged if the STARSHIP_LOG=trace env var is set\r\n\r\nI see this line after the long pause.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::context): Building HashSets of directory files, folders and extensions took 141.401035304s\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also see these module compute times.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>rg compute starship.log | rg -v µs</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 1.200692ms to compute module \"git_branch\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 2.121389ms to compute module \"directory\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.397236675s to compute module \"scala\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.401126115s to compute module \"cobol\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.399494742s to compute module \"hg_branch\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.391331012s to compute module \"helm\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.400926138s to compute module \"php\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.398142933s to compute module \"crystal\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.399844207s to compute module \"docker_context\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.393946183s to compute module \"package\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 1.716138ms to compute module \"pulumi\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 3.731869ms to compute module \"nodejs\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 141.406383333s to compute module \"git_status\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>",
